// Generated by tools/gen_image_manifest.py; edit rows by hand from now
// on (the generator is a one-shot migration aid). Single source of truth
// for every image: the enum in ImageType.hpp AND all_img[] in
// image_directory.cpp both expand from IMAGE_LIST, so the two can never
// drift apart.
//
// To add an image: append ONE row at the END of IMAGE_LIST,
//     X(MY_NEW_IMAGE_DIRECTORY, "./resources/path.png"[, n_sheet, c_sheet[, alpha]])
// The enum value and the all_img[] slot appear together; the
// static_assert in image_directory.cpp still guards the count.
// Row arguments are forwarded verbatim to the Image constructor.
// NOTE: comments inside IMAGE_LIST must be /* */ style -- a // comment
// inside a multi-line macro swallows the rest of the spliced line.
